      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ADD A ZERO (1) had been racing in honest fashion recording four placings in a row before finishing seventh (22.46) at this track latest. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. ANTI VENOM (2) goes very well this trip starting 26 times for 10 wins and 11 minors. Recorded a 4.5 lengths win (21.54) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks well placed here and among the chances. BRUNSWICK BOY (4) jumped from box 2 last time and ran away with an impressive win scoring by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 21.55. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Expected to feature again. SIMULATION (8) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
